OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will start rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain.
OL,7,FSkies will brighten from the northwest
OL,8,Fleaving a mostly fine afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling much fresher in gentle
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly clear and dry night
OL,13,Fto come, with perhaps an isolated
OL,14,Fshower in the northern half of the
OL,15,Fcountry. Feeling cool for many, with
OL,16,Fsome very light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
