OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA dry and bright morning to
OL,6,Fstart Friday with some patchy cloud in
OL,7,Fthe north. Sunshine turning hazy into
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, but feeling warm in the
OL,9,Fsunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday and much of Sunday look dry
OL,13,Fwith some warm spells of sunshine, in
OL,14,Fgentle winds. A chance of some much
OL,15,Fneeded rain developing later on
OL,16,FSunday, and into Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
